Project Planning

ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

1. Project Overview

ComicCraft is an AI-based web application designed to help users create comic stories using Google Gemini models. The project takes a user's simple story idea or prompt and uses AI to generate characters, storylines, dialogues, scenes, and comic panels.


---

2. Project Objectives

Develop an easy-to-use AI comic creation platform.

Generate creative stories using Gemini models.

Automatically create characters and dialogues.

Divide stories into individual comic panels.

Allow users to edit and customize AI-generated content.

Provide a preview of the complete comic.

Allow users to save and export their finished comics.



---

3. Project Scope

The project will include:

1. User registration and login.


2. Story prompt creation.


3. AI-powered story generation.


4. Character generation.


5. Scene and dialogue generation.


6. Comic panel organization.


7. AI-based content regeneration.


8. Comic editing.


9. Comic preview.


10. Saving and exporting comics.




