8. Risk Management

Risk	Solution

Gemini API failure	Implement error handling and retry mechanism
Slow AI response	Use optimized prompts and loading indicators
Incorrect AI-generated content	Allow users to edit and regenerate content
Data loss	Regular database backup
API key exposure	Store API keys securely on the backend
High API usage	Implement request limits and monitoring
Poor user experience	Perform usability testing



---

9. Testing Plan

The project will be tested using:

Unit Testing – Test individual functions/modules.

Integration Testing – Test Gemini API, backend, frontend, and database together.

System Testing – Test the complete application.

UI Testing – Verify buttons, forms, navigation, and comic display.

Performance Testing – Check response and loading times.

User Acceptance Testing – Verify that the application meets user requirements.



---

10. Expected Outcome

At the end of the project, ComicCraft will provide a complete AI-powered comic creation system where users can transform a simple idea into a structured comic story using Gemini models, customize the generated content, preview the comic, and export the final result.
